    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "For Sale by Private Treaty.\r\n\r\nDennehy Auctioneers are delighted to present the last remaining four bedroom residence in this exclusive new development of just eight homes, ideally located in the charming and highly sought after village of Minane Bridge. Perfectly positioned for modern family living, this beautifully finished home is just a one minute walk from the local primary school and convenience shop, placing everyday amenities right on your doorstep. The vibrant village community is surrounded by beautiful countryside, while the bustling town of Carrigaline is just a convenient 10 minute drive away, offering an excellent range of shops, services, schools and amenities.\r\nDesigned with both comfort and energy efficiency in mind, the property has achieved an impressive A rated BER. Features include an air to water heating system, underfloor heating throughout the ground floor, radiators on the first floor ensuring a warm, comfortable and energy efficient home all year round. Internally, the property has been finished to an exceptionally high standard, with a contemporary fitted kitchen, quality floor coverings throughout and stylish, modern bathroom fittings. Generous living accommodation, combined with four well proportioned bedrooms, makes this an ideal home for families looking for space, quality and convenience in a welcoming community setting. With its superb energy credentials, high quality finishes and enviable village location, this outstanding residence represents a rare opportunity to acquire a brand new family home in Minane Bridge.\r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises of Reception Hall, Sitting Room, Guest W.C., Open Plan Kitchen/Dining Room. First floor, Three Bedrooms and Bathroom. Second floor, Master Bedroom Ensuite.\r\n\r\nSpecial Features:\r\n\r\n*A2 N.Z.E.B. Ber Rated.\r\n\r\n*Air To Water Heat Pump System With Underfloor Heating To Ground Floor and Radiators To The Upper Floors.\r\n\r\n*Block Built.\r\n\r\n* Rear Garden is Southwest Facing.\r\n\r\n*Contemporary Fitted Kitchens.\r\n\r\n*Comes With Floor Coverings and Tiling."
      },
      {
